+        </dependency>
+
+        <!-- The host API — the only Gangland-local artifact this module compiles against (WS5 G1 boundary
+             rule: never gangland-impl, never gangland-domain — the api re-exports gangland-core at compile
+             scope, so User/IdentitySettings/Messages/Settings/Command/the seam interfaces all resolve
+             transitively through this one dependency). Provided: at runtime this module is loaded from
+             plugins/Gangland_Warfare/modules/ by Keystone's ModuleLoader, whose parent is the host plugin's
